WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.301
-As you guys know, we're always

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.770
striving to get better here
at "The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:07.340
[ As Daft Punk ] ♪ Harder,
better, faster, stronger ♪

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.677
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:12.578
Which is why we asked viewers
at home to send in

00:00:12.578 --> 00:00:14.914
any suggestions that they have
just to get some feedback

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.248
about what you guys think
of the show,

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.318
things you'd like to see us do,
that kind of stuff.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:21.688
So tonight, let's look inside
the audience suggestion box!

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:25.258
♪ Look into the box,
the suggestion box ♪

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:27.193
[ Cheers and applause ]
-There we go.

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:31.931
This first one here is from
Rosemary Woods.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.734
"Hey, Jimmy, I saw that
Lifetime Channel started airing

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:36.336
their new Christmas movies
this week,

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.204
even though it's not even
Halloween yet.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.572
Maybe you could review some
on the show."

00:00:40.572 --> 00:00:43.009
Gosh, I'd really like to,
but I just don't have the time

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:45.277
to watch Lifetime Christmas
movies right now.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:46.579
Sorry.
-Jimmy,

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.880
what are you talking about?

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.683
There's always time
for Lifetime Christmas movies

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:54.153
no matter what time of year
it is.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:55.654
-No, Tariq.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:58.090
[ Sighs ] There isn't.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:01.327
Between this show and the
election, and moving back

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.895
to my hometown to help
with my family's

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.631
struggling wreath farm...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.631 --> 00:01:08.334
it's just not realistic. Okay?

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.802
-Wow.

00:01:09.802 --> 00:01:14.206
I-I had no idea you were -- you
were under so much pressure.

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:17.710
-Yeah, well, I am.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.280
And to top it all off, I have to
plan the big holiday parade

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.982
that the whole town comes to
and I don't even have a theme

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.017
picked out yet.

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:29.955
-Well, Jimmy, the answer might
be closer than you think.

00:01:29.955 --> 00:01:32.692
Look under your desk.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:37.863
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:39.999
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.368
It's a snow globe I made
when I was a kid.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.103
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:45.805
That's it, the --
the theme of the parade

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.373
should be "snow globes."

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.509
And my family can sell
our wreaths at the parade

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.810
to save the farm,
and then I'll have time

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.312
to watch Lifetime movies!

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.181
That fixes everything!

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.650
Thanks, Tariq.

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.185
Tariq?

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.120
[ Sleigh bells ringing ]

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.090
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.460
You just saved Christmas, bud.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.396
-Hello, Lifetime Channel? Yeah,
you can send that check now.

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.398
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:16.101
-All right, let's get to
our next suggestion here.

00:02:16.101 --> 00:02:18.003
This one's from Michelle Brown.

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:20.239
"Hey, Jimmy, I'm glad everyone
is staying safe

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:22.341
by canceling their Halloween
parties this year.

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.477
But I'm really going to miss
all the fun Halloween games.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.645
Do you think you could give us
some Halloween fun

00:02:26.645 --> 00:02:28.714
by bobbing for an apple?"

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:30.983
Uh, sure, I'd love to.

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:33.085
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.085 --> 00:02:36.990 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:41.528
[ Sighs ]

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:43.429
-Whoo!

00:02:43.429 --> 00:02:44.864
An iPhone, cool.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:48.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.938
These are waterproof, right?

00:02:52.938 --> 00:02:57.143
All right, let's get another
suggestion here.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:03:00.547
This one doesn't have a name
on it.

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:03.383
But, anyway, it says, "Hey,
Jimmy, here's a suggestion --

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:04.817
suck it."

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.420
[ Bass playing ]

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.822
Hey, Ma-- Mark, did you do this?

00:03:09.822 --> 00:03:11.457
-Yeah, that's right. Suck it!

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.192
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:15.194
-No! You suck it!

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:16.729
[ Bass playing ]

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.531
-No, you suck it!

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.699
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:22.168
-I hate you, Mark!

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:24.570
-I hate you, too, Jimmy!

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.439
-Next suggestion!

00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.740
-Good!

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.110
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:34.714 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:38.384
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:41.620
-"Hey, Jimmy, I love Halloween.
I also love WWE.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.723
Is there any way you can combine
the two?"

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:46.892
I can't, but I know who can.

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:49.862
And his name, The Undertaker.

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.964
Check it out.

00:03:51.964 --> 00:03:55.267
[ Wolf howling ]

00:03:55.267 --> 00:03:57.169
[ Insects chirping ]

00:03:57.169 --> 00:03:58.671
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:01.807
[ Bell tolling ]

00:04:01.807 --> 00:04:06.979
♪♪

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:12.184
♪♪

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:17.356
♪♪

00:04:17.356 --> 00:04:22.562
♪♪

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:27.066
-[ Growls ]

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:31.638
[ Grunts ]

00:04:31.638 --> 00:04:35.541
[ Sighs ]

00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:37.576
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:41.948
♪♪

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:46.019
Rest...in...

00:04:46.019 --> 00:04:50.756
peace.

00:04:50.756 --> 00:04:52.191
[ Bell tolls ]

00:04:52.191 --> 00:04:53.459
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.962
-Our thanks to The Undertaker.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:04:58.531
Undertaker's 30th anniversary
will be celebrated

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:01.968
at Survivor Series on Sunday,
November 22nd

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.103
streaming on WWE Network.
We love that guy.

00:05:05.103 --> 00:05:08.574
Thanks again, Undertaker.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:11.044
We are down to our last
suggestion.

00:05:11.044 --> 00:05:13.379
It is from Ramona Ostrowski.

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:16.182
"Hey, Jimmy, I loved
Black Simon &amp; Garfunkel.

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:18.050
Can you have them on the show
again?"

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:20.386
Actually, it's so weird
you actually asked that

00:05:20.386 --> 00:05:22.989
because last night, I was having
a socially distant dinner

00:05:22.989 --> 00:05:26.559
over at Mendel's on the park,
and Black Simon &amp; Garfunkel

00:05:26.559 --> 00:05:29.528
showed up to sing a new version
of one their classic songs.

00:05:29.528 --> 00:05:33.966
So, here to perform
"Scarborough Fair Online,"

00:05:33.966 --> 00:05:36.669
give it up for
Black Simon &amp; Garfunkel.

00:05:36.669 --> 00:05:38.037
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:38.037 --> 00:05:42.842
♪♪

00:05:42.842 --> 00:05:47.646
♪♪

00:05:47.646 --> 00:05:53.652
-♪ Are you going to
Scarborough Fair? ♪

00:05:53.652 --> 00:05:54.953
♪♪

00:05:54.953 --> 00:06:01.660
♪ It got pushed,
and now it's online ♪

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:03.863
♪♪

00:06:03.863 --> 00:06:10.002
♪ They're showing every spice
on Screen Share♪

00:06:10.002 --> 00:06:11.304
♪♪

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:18.244
♪ I just chugged my fourth
glass of wine ♪

00:06:18.244 --> 00:06:21.080
♪♪

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:26.986
♪ Are you going to
my cousin's bris? ♪

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:28.687
♪♪

00:06:28.687 --> 00:06:34.593
♪ Why'd the hell
they move this online? ♪

00:06:34.593 --> 00:06:37.230
♪♪

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:43.636
♪ They're live streaming
to my Oculus ♪

00:06:43.636 --> 00:06:44.870
♪♪

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:50.276
♪ I hit HD at the worst time ♪

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:52.278
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:56.215
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:56.215 --> 00:07:01.954
♪♪

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:05.858
-Give it up for
Black Simon &amp; Garfunkel!

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:09.028
That is all the time we have
for "Audience Suggestion Box."

